This is a guide for how to create [[Blessed Champion Arrows]] - the highest damage arrows in the game for [[Warrior]]s, [[Paladin]]s, and [[Ranger]]s that worship Tunare. If you worship Karana, you will want to use [[Blessed Guardian Arrows]] instead.

Additionally, you can save steps and money by leaving out the emeralds from the guide below. Follow the guide but ignore the emeralds and you will make [[Mithril Champion Arrows]] which are almost just as good, but cheaper to make.

= Skills =

You will need at least the following trade skills to complete all of the combines. You may want to get higher skill, or Mastery AAs - neither are required but will significantly reduce failures and save platinum. Maxing out the arrows, without using motes, will require successfully crafting 1024 arrows. So reducing your failure rate can be quite valuable.

* [[Skill Blacksmithing|Smithing]] - 100
* [[Skill Fletching|Fletching]] - 200

= Materials =

This is a table of all the materials needed and where to get them. I have only included the materials required to craft the arrows themselves. There are a few tools you will need to make first, but those are one time combines. The materials listed below you will be using a lot of. Each attempt to make an arrow will cost, at a minimum, ~18pp. However, you will occasionally fail the intermediate steps and need buy more supplies than the absolute minimum, so expect it to cost closer to 20-25pp per combine.

