== Imbued Emerald Shards ==
You will need to take the [[Emerald]]s purchased from a merchant and have them imbued by a [[Druid]]. Then you will turn them into shards in the [[Feir`Dal Forge]] using the recipe below. These are used to make the [[Blessed Arrow Heads]]. You can choose to skip this step and make the arrow heads without the emeralds - the rest of the guide below stays the same, you just don't include the imbued emeralds.  The resulting arrows without the emeralds are the [[Mithril Champion Arrows]]. They have one less fire damage and don't require Tunare.

* [[Skill Blacksmithing|Blacksmithing]] (Trivial: 96)
** '''Yield: Imbued Emerald Shards''' x4
** In [[Feir`Dal Forge]]:
:: {{SmIcon|1035}} 1x [[File]]
:: {{SmIcon|958}} 1x [[Imbued Emerald]]

= Tools =

These are the tools you will need access to for completing the combines. You only need to have <em>one</em> of each of these tools; they are always returned after each combine, even on a failure.

== Feir`Dal Forge ==

The [[Feir`Dal Forge]] is required for smithing the parts of the arrows. It can be found in Kelethin just behind [[Merchant Ainaiana]].

== File ==

You will need to make a [[File]] to use for several of the combines. You likely already have one from leveling up Smithing.
* [[Blacksmithing]] (Trivial: 21)
** '''Yield: File''' x1
** In [[Forge]]:
:: {{SmIcon|1031}} 1 x [[Metal Bits]]
:: {{SmIcon|1151}} 1 x [[File Mold]]
:: {{SmIcon|584}} 1 x [[Flask of Water]]

== Mithril Working Knife ==

You will need to make a [[Mithril Working Knife]] which is used for creating the fletching used in the arrows. The Hilt mold is sold by [[Merchant Nluolian]], who also sells the Fletching Kit molds you will need. Unfortunately, no one sells the [[Dagger Blade Mold]] in Kelethin - that I could find. I had to get them from [[Opal Leganyn]] in [[Northern Felwithe]].

* [[Skill Blacksmithing|Blacksmithing]] (Trivial: 42)
** '''Yield: Mithril Working Knife'''
** In [[Feir`Dal Forge]]:
:: {{SmIcon|1138}} 1x [[Small Brick of Mithril]]
:: {{SmIcon|1151}} 1x [[Hilt Mold]]
:: {{SmIcon|1151}} 1x [[Dagger Blade Mold]]
:: {{SmIcon|584}} 1x [[Water Flask]]

== Feir`Dal Fletching Kit ==

This recipe is trivial at 163 Smithing, so you might fail a few times - but you only need to succeed once and it's not worth the time and platinum getting it to trivial. You can get all three molds required from [[Merchant Nluolian]] in Kelethin.

* [[Skill Blacksmithing|Blacksmithing]] (Trivial: 163)
** '''Yield: Feir`Dal Fletching Kit'''
** In [[Feir`Dal Forge]]:
:: {{SmIcon|584}} 1x [[Water Flask]]
:: {{SmIcon|1138}} 1x [[Small Brick of Mithril]]
:: {{SmIcon|1151}} 1x [[Hinge Mold]]
:: {{SmIcon|1151}} 1x [[Container Base Mold]]
:: {{SmIcon|1151}} 1x [[Container Lid Mold]]

= Arrow Parts =
These are the parts of the arrows you will need to make the final combine. Like all arrows there are four parts: Head, Shaft, Fletching, and Nock. Keep in mind, you will need to manually make each of these parts successfully at least once before you can auto-combine them.

